The Regulation applies from 2 August 2026, except:
(a) Chapters I and II apply from 2 February 2025;
(b) Chapter III Section 4, Chapter V, Chapter VII, Chapter XII, and Article 78 apply from 2 August 2025 (except Article 101);
(c) Article 6(1) and the corresponding obligations in this Regulation apply from 2 August 2027.
